    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="ch9subch2">

                <pb facs="0500" n="486" xml:id="pg486"/>

                <head>Interest of the United States in resolving the dispute between Afghanistan and
                    Iran regarding distribution of the waters of the Helmand River<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="ch9subch2-f1"/>
                </head>
                <p>[Discussion of this question continued in Washington in 1948 between Afghan and
                    Iranian representatives under the informal good offices of the Department of
                    State. The Department suggested the preparation of an: advance Study of the
                    Helmand water flow by an American engineer and offered its assistance in the
                    selection of an international fact-finding commission. Documentation on these
                    developments, which continued through 1949, is in Department of State file
                    890H.6461.]</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
